     "id": "f969e1bd-135e-445a-9f3d-377844322698"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Perturbation machinery (copied from W4 E4 part 1): operator coefficient blocks as exact cubic polynomials in g = diag(zeta), degenerate Rayleigh-Schroedinger recursion, Laurent series of the commuting family",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "checks = Join[checks, ck];\nck = <||>;\nthN = {2/7, -3/5}; th12 = 31/35;\nmons = Flatten[Table[{a, b, c}, {a, 0, 3}, {b, 0, 3 - a}, {c, 0, 3 - a - b}], 2];\npw[x_, 0] := 1; pw[x_, k_] := x^k;\nmonV[g_] := Table[pw[g[[1]], m[[1]]] pw[g[[2]], m[[2]]] pw[g[[3]], m[[3]]], {m, mons}];\ngPts = Tuples[{0, 1, -1, 2}, 3];\ngExtra = {{3/2, -5/7, 2/9}, {-4/3, 5/2, 1/7}};\ndesignM = monV /@ gPts;\nck[\"design matrix rank = 20\"] = MatrixRank[designM];\nopNames = {\"H1\", \"H2\", \"a1\", \"a2\", \"b1\", \"b2\"};\nopAt[R_, g_, sec_, Ib_] := Module[{LD = laurentX[R, DiagonalMatrix[g], thN, Ib]},\n  {LD[\"H\"][[1]], LD[\"H\"][[2]], LD[\"a\"][[1]], LD[\"a\"][[2]], LD[\"b\"][[1]], LD[\"b\"][[2]]}];\n(* operator coefficient blocks: opPolyOfT[Lam,mu,th][\"coef\"][name] = list over mons of n x n rational matrices on the weight-mu sector (the twisted Hamiltonians commute with the total Cartan) *)\nopPolyOf[Lam_, mu_] := opPolyOfT[Lam, mu, thN];\nopPolyOfT[Lam_, mu_, thArg_] := opPolyOfT[Lam, mu, thArg] = Block[{thN = thArg}, Module[{R = build[Lam], sec = secOf[Lam, mu], n, Ib, vals, design = designM, sols, offsec, chk},\n  n = Length[sec]; Ib = Normal[SparseArray[Transpose[{sec, Range[n]}] -> 1, {R[\"d2\"], n}]];\n  vals = Table[opAt[R, g, sec, Ib], {g, gPts}];\n  offsec = And @@ Flatten[Table[Union[Flatten[Delete[v[[k]], List /@ sec]]] === {0}, {v, vals}, {k, 6}]];\n  sols = Table[With[{V = Table[Flatten[vals[[ip, k]][[sec]]], {ip, Length[gPts]}]}, Partition[#, n] & /@ LinearSolve[design, V]], {k, 6}];\n  chk = And @@ Flatten[Table[With[{vx = opAt[R, g, sec, Ib]}, Table[vx[[k]][[sec]] === Total[Table[monV[g][[im]] sols[[k, im]], {im, Length[mons]}]], {k, 6}]], {g, gExtra}]];\n  <|\"coef\" -> AssociationThread[opNames -> sols], \"offsec\" -> offsec, \"extraOK\" -> chk, \"n\" -> n|>]];\n(* field arithmetic: elements are expressions a + b sq, sq^2 = dD *)\nrd[x_] := If[dD === 0, Expand[x], PolynomialRemainder[Expand[x], sq^2 - dD, sq]];\ncj[x_] := x /. sq -> -sq;\nfdiv[x_, y_] := If[dD === 0, Expand[x/y], rd[rd[x cj[y]]]/rd[y cj[y]]];\nfdotv[a_, b_] := rd[a . b];\nopSeries[ops_, name_, phi_, kmax_] := Table[Sum[(Times @@ MapThread[pw, {phi, mons[[im]]}]) ops[\"coef\"][name][[im]], {im, Select[Range[Length[mons]], Total[mons[[#]]] == k &]}], {k, 0, kmax}];\nrsSolve[Aks_, psi0_, lam0_, nMax_] := Module[{n = Length[psi0], K = Length[Aks] - 1, M0, M1, ell, ell0, ell1, lsf, lams = {lam0}, psis = {psi0}, big, kerv, split, lp, ev0},\n  ev0 = rd /@ (Aks[[1]] . psi0 - lam0 psi0);\n  If[dD === 0,\n   ell = First[NullSpace[Transpose[Aks[[1]]] - lam0 IdentityMatrix[n]]]; ell0 = ell; ell1 = 0 ell,\n   Module[{p = Coefficient[lam0, sq, 0], q = Coefficient[lam0, sq, 1], Mt0, Mt1},\n    Mt0 = Transpose[Aks[[1]]] - p IdentityMatrix[n]; Mt1 = -q IdentityMatrix[n];\n    kerv = First[NullSpace[ArrayFlatten[{{Mt0, dD Mt1}, {Mt1, Mt0}}]]];\n    ell0 = kerv[[1 ;; n]]; ell1 = kerv[[n + 1 ;; 2 n]]; ell = ell0 + sq ell1]];\n  If[dD === 0,\n   big = Join[Aks[[1]] - lam0 IdentityMatrix[n], {ell}]; lsf = Quiet[LinearSolve[big], LinearSolve::sqmat1];\n   split[v_] := Join[v, {0}],\n   Module[{p = Coefficient[lam0, sq, 0], q = Coefficient[lam0, sq, 1], M0m, M1m},\n    M0m = Aks[[1]] - p IdentityMatrix[n]; M1m = -q IdentityMatrix[n];\n    big = Join[ArrayFlatten[{{M0m, dD M1m}, {M1m, M0m}}], {Join[ell0, dD ell1], Join[ell1, ell0]}]; lsf = Quiet[LinearSolve[big], LinearSolve::sqmat1];\n    split[v_] := Join[Coefficient[#, sq, 0] & /@ v, Coefficient[#, sq, 1] & /@ v, {0, 0}]]];\n  Do[Module[{Apsi, lamn, rhs, sol},\n    Apsi = Sum[rd /@ (Aks[[k + 1]] . psis[[nn - k + 1]]), {k, 1, Min[nn, K]}];\n    lamn = fdiv[rd[ell . Apsi], rd[ell . psi0]];\n    AppendTo[lams, lamn];\n    rhs = rd /@ (-Apsi + lamn psi0 + Sum[lams[[k + 1]] psis[[nn - k + 1]], {k, 1, nn - 1}]);\n    sol = lsf[split[rhs]];\n    AppendTo[psis, If[dD === 0, rd /@ sol, rd /@ (sol[[1 ;; n]] + sq sol[[n + 1 ;; 2 n]])]]], {nn, 1, nMax}];\n  <|\"lam\" -> (rd /@ lams), \"psi\" -> psis, \"ell\" -> ell, \"ev0\" -> ev0|>];\n(* Laurent data series x(eps) of an operator-coefficient list Xks on the branch: x(eps) Psi = X(eps) Psi solved at the pivot component, full eigen-equation checked *)\nlaurSeries[Xks_, psis_, nMax_] := Module[{K = Length[Xks] - 1, pv = First@Select[Range[Length[psis[[1]]]], psis[[1, #]] =!= 0 &], ys, xs = {}, res},\n  ys = Table[Sum[rd /@ (Xks[[k + 1]] . psis[[nn - k + 1]]), {k, 0, Min[nn, K]}], {nn, 0, nMax}];\n  Do[AppendTo[xs, fdiv[rd[ys[[nn + 1, pv]] - Sum[xs[[k + 1]] psis[[nn - k + 1, pv]], {k, 0, nn - 1}]], psis[[1, pv]]]], {nn, 0, nMax}];\n  res = Table[rd /@ (ys[[nn + 1]] - Sum[xs[[k + 1]] psis[[nn - k + 1]], {k, 0, nn}]), {nn, 0, nMax}];\n  {xs, Max[Abs[Flatten[res /. sq -> 1]]] === 0 || Union[Flatten[res]] === {0}}];\ntrimOps[l_] := With[{nz = Select[Range[Length[l]], Union[Flatten[l[[#]]]] =!= {0} &]}, If[nz === {}, {l[[1]]}, Take[l, Max[nz]]]];\nserConv[a_, b_, nmax_] := Table[rd[Sum[a[[k + 1]] b[[nn - k + 1]], {k, 0, nn}]], {nn, 0, nmax}];\nrhoI = 1/7;\nphiA = {1/3, -2/7, 5/11}; phiB = {-2/5, 3/8, 7/11};\n\"machinery defined\"",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"953927\" data-output-id=\"2\" data-out-n=\"83\" data-sub-idx=\"28\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"7\" data-sub-start=\"61\" data-sub-end=\"61\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[83]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><pre class=\"vscode-wolfram-text-output\">No output at Out[83]</pre></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
