  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## B3 prelude: operator polynomials on every HW sector, and the separation test of the isolating operator H1 + a1/7 at eps -> 0",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* speed-up over the W4 version: the sector identity block is a SparseArray (25x faster than dense exact arithmetic on the 225-dim chain); results are Normal-ised *)\nopAt[R_, g_, sec_, Ib_] := Module[{LD = laurentX[R, DiagonalMatrix[g], thN, Ib]},\n  Normal /@ {LD[\"H\"][[1]], LD[\"H\"][[2]], LD[\"a\"][[1]], LD[\"a\"][[2]], LD[\"b\"][[1]], LD[\"b\"][[2]]}];\nopPolyOfT[Lam_, mu_, thArg_] := opPolyOfT[Lam, mu, thArg] = Block[{thN = thArg}, Module[{R = build[Lam], sec = secOf[Lam, mu], n, Ib, vals, design = designM, sols, offsec, chk},\n  n = Length[sec]; Ib = SparseArray[Transpose[{sec, Range[n]}] -> 1, {R[\"d2\"], n}];\n  vals = Table[opAt[R, g, sec, Ib], {g, gPts}];\n  offsec = And @@ Flatten[Table[Union[Flatten[Delete[v[[k]], List /@ sec]]] === {0}, {v, vals}, {k, 6}]];\n  sols = Table[With[{V = Table[Flatten[vals[[ip, k]][[sec]]], {ip, Length[gPts]}]}, Partition[#, n] & /@ LinearSolve[design, V]], {k, 6}];\n  chk = And @@ Flatten[Table[With[{vx = opAt[R, g, sec, Ib]}, Table[vx[[k]][[sec]] === Total[Table[monV[g][[im]] sols[[k, im]], {im, Length[mons]}]], {k, 6}]], {g, gExtra}]];\n  <|\"coef\" -> AssociationThread[opNames -> sols], \"offsec\" -> offsec, \"extraOK\" -> chk, \"n\" -> n|>]];\nClearAll[opPolyOf]; opPolyOf[Lam_, mu_] := opPolyOfT[Lam, mu, thN];\ntOp = <||>; gapTab = {};\nDo[Do[tOp[{Lam, mu}] = First@AbsoluteTiming[opPolyOf[Lam, mu]], {mu, hwSecsOf[Lam]}], {Lam, repList}];\nck[\"operator polynomials: offsec zero and extra-point exact, all sectors\"] = And @@ Flatten[Table[{opPolyOf[Lam, mu][\"offsec\"], opPolyOf[Lam, mu][\"extraOK\"]}, {Lam, repList}, {mu, hwSecsOf[Lam]}]];\n(* separation of the unperturbed eigenvalue lam0 = (eta + rho alpha)/th12 of Aop(0) = H1(0) + rho a1(0): distance to the rest of the spectrum on the weight-mu space *)\nDo[Do[Module[{ops = opPolyOf[Lam, mu], bd = branchData[Lam, mu], A0, ev, gaps},\n   A0 = N[ops[\"coef\"][\"H1\"][[1]] + rhoI ops[\"coef\"][\"a1\"][[1]], 30]; ev = Eigenvalues[A0];\n   gaps = Table[With[{lam0 = N[(b[\"eta\"][[1, 1]] + rhoI (b[\"alpha\"][[1, 1]] + Sqrt[b[\"D0\"]] b[\"alpha\"][[1, 2]]))/th12, 30]}, Sort[Abs[ev - lam0]][[1 ;; 2]]], {b, bd}];\n   AppendTo[gapTab, {Lam, mu, Length[ev], gaps}]], {mu, hwSecsOf[Lam]}], {Lam, repList}];\ndump[Join[{N[Values[tOp], 4]}, {ck[\"operator polynomials: offsec zero and extra-point exact, all sectors\"]}, gapTab /. x_?InexactNumberQ :> N[x, 4]]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
