  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## C3: the cyclic subspace C_B of the HW vector and the characteristic polynomial chi_B(lambda; eps, phi) of H1 on it\n\nC_B = span{H1^i a1^j Psi_0} over Q(eps) (Q(eps,Sqrt[D0]) for the mult-2 copies; Psi_0 the HW ket of the branch). Dimension by exact rank at several rational eps (generic value = rank over Q(eps)); the restricted characteristic polynomial of H1 is computed at 3d+5 rational eps (matrix of H1 in the Krylov basis of the isolating operator A = H1 + a1/7, exact in Q(Sqrt[D0])) and interpolated: coefficient of lambda^k is a polynomial in eps of degree <= 3(d-k) (H1 has entries cubic in zeta = eps phi), checked on the spare points. The branch eigenvalue series (cell B3) must be annihilated by chi_B (to eps^10), and by exactly one irreducible factor.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "checks = Join[checks, ck]; ck = <||>;\nopMatE[ops_, nm_, phi_, e_] := Total[MapIndexed[e^(#2[[1]] - 1) #1 &, opSeries[ops, nm, phi, 3]]];\nembedRows[uA_, uB_, D0_] := If[D0 === 0, {uA}, {Join[uA, uB], Join[D0 uB, uA]}];\nrkOf[ws_, D0_] := MatrixRank[Flatten[embedRows[#[[1]], #[[2]], D0] & /@ ws, 1]]/If[D0 === 0, 1, 2];\n(* dimension of the cyclic subspace of a commuting list of matrices acting on the vector vA + Sqrt[D0] vB (Q(Sqrt[D0])-dimension) *)\norbitDim[mats_, vA_, vB_, D0_] := Module[{basis = {}, rk = 0, queue = {{vA, vB}}, u, emb, nr},\n  While[queue =!= {}, u = First[queue]; queue = Rest[queue]; emb = embedRows[u[[1]], u[[2]], D0];\n   nr = MatrixRank[Join[basis, emb]];\n   If[nr > rk, rk = nr; basis = Join[basis, emb]; queue = Join[queue, ({# . u[[1]], # . u[[2]]} & /@ mats)]]];\n  If[D0 === 0, rk, rk/2]];\nkrylovA[A_, vA_, vB_, D0_] := Module[{ws = {{vA, vB}}, nw},\n  While[nw = {A . ws[[-1, 1]], A . ws[[-1, 2]]}; rkOf[Append[ws, nw], D0] > Length[ws], AppendTo[ws, nw]]; ws];\n(* coordinates of the pair-vector u in the (pair) basis ws *)\ncoordsIn[ws_, u_, D0_] := Module[{WA = Transpose[ws[[All, 1]]], WB = Transpose[ws[[All, 2]]], d = Length[ws], sol},\n  If[D0 === 0, sol = LinearSolve[WA, u[[1]]]; sol + 0 sq,\n   sol = LinearSolve[ArrayFlatten[{{WA, D0 WB}, {WB, WA}}], Join[u[[1]], u[[2]]]]; sol[[1 ;; d]] + sq sol[[d + 1 ;;]]]];\n(* Faddeev-LeVerrier characteristic polynomial, ascending coefficients, arithmetic reduced mod sq^2 = D0 *)\ncharCoeffs[Mx_] := Module[{nn = Length[Mx], Mk, cs = {1}, I0},\n  I0 = IdentityMatrix[nn]; Mk = ConstantArray[0, {nn, nn}];\n  Do[Mk = Map[rd, Mx . Mk + First[cs] I0, {2}]; cs = Prepend[cs, rd[-Tr[Mx . Mk]/kk]], {kk, nn}]; cs];\nsampleEps[m_] := Table[j/(j + 11), {j, 1, m}];\n(* one branch at one eps: dimensions and the pair coefficient list of the restricted char poly of H1 on K_A *)\ncycAt[Lam_, mu_, ic_, phi_, e_] := Module[{ops = opPolyOf[Lam, mu], bd = branchData[Lam, mu][[ic]], sec = secOf[Lam, mu], D0, vA, vB, H, a, b, H2, a2, b2, A, ws, d, Hm, cs, dAlg, dFull},\n  D0 = bd[\"D0\"]; dD = D0; vA = bd[\"vA\"][[sec]]; vB = bd[\"vB\"][[sec]];\n  {H, H2, a, a2, b, b2} = opMatE[ops, #, phi, e] & /@ opNames;\n  A = H + rhoI a; ws = krylovA[A, vA, vB, D0]; d = Length[ws];\n  dAlg = orbitDim[{H, a}, vA, vB, D0]; dFull = orbitDim[{H, a, b, H2, a2, b2}, vA, vB, D0];\n  Hm = Transpose[Table[coordsIn[ws, {H . ws[[k, 1]], H . ws[[k, 2]]}, D0], {k, d}]];\n  cs = charCoeffs[Hm];\n  <|\"dA\" -> d, \"dAlg\" -> dAlg, \"dFull\" -> dFull, \"cs\" -> cs|>];\n(* ascending-lambda coefficient list of chi as polynomials in eps, interpolated from the samples *)\ncycBranch[Lam_, mu_, ic_, phi_] := Module[{pts, dat, d, good, spareOK = True, cs},\n  dD = branchData[Lam, mu][[ic]][\"D0\"];\n  pts = sampleEps[4]; dat = Table[cycAt[Lam, mu, ic, phi, e], {e, pts}]; d = Max[dat[[All, \"dA\"]]];\n  pts = sampleEps[3 d + 5]; dat = Table[cycAt[Lam, mu, ic, phi, e], {e, pts}];\n  good = Flatten[Position[dat[[All, \"dA\"]], d]];\n  cs = Table[Module[{pairs = Table[{pts[[i]], dat[[i, \"cs\", k + 1]]}, {i, good}], deg = 3 (d - k), pol},\n    pol = InterpolatingPolynomial[Take[pairs, deg + 1], eps]; pol = rd[Expand[pol]];\n    If[Union[Table[rd[Expand[(pol /. eps -> p[[1]]) - p[[2]]]], {p, Drop[pairs, deg + 1]}]] =!= {0}, spareOK = False];\n    pol], {k, 0, d - 1}];\n  <|\"d\" -> d, \"dAlg\" -> Max[dat[[All, \"dAlg\"]]], \"dFull\" -> Max[dat[[All, \"dFull\"]]], \"dAll\" -> Union[dat[[All, \"dA\"]]], \"dAlgAll\" -> Union[dat[[All, \"dAlg\"]]], \"chi\" -> Append[cs, 1], \"spareOK\" -> spareOK, \"nGood\" -> Length[good], \"D0\" -> dD|>];\n(* annihilation of the series by a lambda-polynomial given as ascending coefficient list (polynomials in eps, possibly with sq) *)\nannih[cl_, Hs_, nmax_] := Module[{pwr = sPad[{1}, nmax], res = ConstantArray[0, nmax + 1]},\n  Do[res = res + serConv[sPad[CoefficientList[cl[[k + 1]], eps], nmax], pwr, nmax]; pwr = serConv[pwr, Hs, nmax], {k, 0, Length[cl] - 1}]; rd /@ res];\nchiExpr[cyc_] := Sum[cyc[\"chi\"][[k + 1]] lam^k, {k, 0, cyc[\"d\"]}] /. sq -> If[cyc[\"D0\"] === 0, 0, Sqrt[cyc[\"D0\"]]];\ncycRes = <||>;\nrunCyc[Lam_] := Do[Do[Module[{k = {Lam, b, pp[[1]]}, cyc, r = resN[{Lam, b, pp[[1]]}], facs, fcl, annih0, brF},\n   cyc = cycBranch[Lam, b[[1]], b[[2]], pp[[2]]]; dD = cyc[\"D0\"];\n   annih0 = Union[annih[cyc[\"chi\"], r[\"series\"][\"H1\"], nMaxN]] === {0};\n   facs = If[dD === 0, FactorList[chiExpr[cyc]], FactorList[chiExpr[cyc], Extension -> Sqrt[dD]]];\n   facs = Select[facs, ! FreeQ[#[[1]], lam] &];\n   fcl = Table[CoefficientList[f[[1]], lam] /. Sqrt[dD] -> sq, {f, facs}];\n   brF = Select[Range[Length[facs]], Union[annih[fcl[[#]], r[\"series\"][\"H1\"], nMaxN]] === {0} &];\n   cycRes[k] = Join[cyc, <|\"annihilated\" -> annih0, \"factors\" -> facs, \"branchFactorIdx\" -> brF, \"branchFactorDeg\" -> (Exponent[facs[[#, 1]], lam] & /@ brF)|>]], {b, branchesOf[Lam]}, {pp, {{\"A\", phiA}, {\"B\", phiB}}}], {Lam}];\nrunCyc[{2, 1, 0}];\ndump[Table[{k[[2]], k[[3]], cycRes[k][\"d\"], cycRes[k][\"dAlg\"], cycRes[k][\"dFull\"], cycRes[k][\"dAll\"], cycRes[k][\"spareOK\"], cycRes[k][\"annihilated\"], Exponent[#[[1]], lam] & /@ cycRes[k][\"factors\"], cycRes[k][\"branchFactorDeg\"]}, {k, Keys[cycRes]}]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"953927\" data-output-id=\"12\" data-out-n=\"203\" data-sub-idx=\"22\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"22\" data-sub-start=\"55\" data-sub-end=\"55\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[203]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><pre class=\"vscode-wolfram-text-output\">No output at Out[203]</pre></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[203]= No output at Out[203]",
