     ],
     "id": "33230b49-ef6b-4ee8-b26e-860bb78d14a9"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## C3 for [3,1,0] and [3,2,0] (numeric phi_A, phi_B, eps symbolic)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "tC = <||>;\nDo[tC[Lam] = First@AbsoluteTiming[runCyc[Lam]], {Lam, {{3, 1, 0}, {3, 2, 0}}}];\ndump[Join[{tC}, Table[{k[[1]], k[[2]], k[[3]], cycRes[k][\"d\"], cycRes[k][\"dAlg\"], cycRes[k][\"dFull\"], cycRes[k][\"dAll\"], cycRes[k][\"spareOK\"], cycRes[k][\"annihilated\"], Exponent[#[[1]], lam] & /@ cycRes[k][\"factors\"], cycRes[k][\"branchFactorDeg\"]}, {k, Select[Keys[cycRes], #[[1]] =!= {2, 1, 0} &]}]]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## C2: closed-form 2x2 matrix of H1 on C_B for the d = 2 branches (symbolic zeta = (z1,z2,z3), symbolic theta12 via the exact scaling H^(n) ~ theta12^(n-1))\n\nBasis of the weight-mu space (dimension 2 = d): e1 = HW ket of mu (the branch limit state), e2 = the G-orthogonal complement vector (the weight-mu vector of the neighbouring irrep, a descendant of the HW vector with weight mu + (e_i - e_j) lowered). Matrix in the basis (e1,e2): M = P^-1 H1 P.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "checks = Join[checks, ck]; ck = <||>;\nzz = {z1, z2, z3}; thS = Symbol[\"t12\"];\n(* H1, a1, b1 with symbolic zeta and theta12: sum over the homogeneous parts of the operator polynomials at theta = (1,0) times theta12^(n-1) (H, a) or theta12^(n-2) (b) *)\nopSym[Lam_, mu_, nm_] := Module[{ser = opSeries[opPolyOfT[Lam, mu, {1, 0}], nm, zz, 3]}, Sum[thS^(k - If[StringTake[nm, 1] == \"b\", 2, 1]) ser[[k + 1]], {k, 0, 3}]];\nc2Res = <||>;\nDo[Module[{Lam = k[[1]], mu = k[[2]], sec, bd, G, e1, e2, P, H, a, M, Ma, trM, detM, chiS, numChk, e = 2/5, thv = 31/35, gs, ok},\n  sec = secOf[Lam, mu]; bd = branchData[Lam, mu][[1]]; gs = build[Lam][\"gd2\"][[sec]];\n  e1 = bd[\"vA\"][[sec]]; e2 = First@NullSpace[{gs e1}];  (* G-orthogonal to e1 *)\n  P = Transpose[{e1, e2}];\n  H = opSym[Lam, mu, \"H1\"]; a = opSym[Lam, mu, \"a1\"];\n  M = Map[Factor, Inverse[P] . H . P, {2}]; Ma = Map[Factor, Inverse[P] . a . P, {2}];\n  trM = Factor[Tr[M]]; detM = Factor[Det[M]];\n  (* check against the interpolated numeric chi of cell C3 (theta12 = 31/35, eps = 2/5, phiA): eps*phi = zeta *)\n  chiS = lam^2 - trM lam + detM;\n  ok = Simplify[(chiS /. t12 -> thv /. Thread[zz -> e phiA]) - (chiExpr[cycRes[{Lam, {mu, 1}, \"A\"}]] /. eps -> e)] === 0;\n  c2Res[k] = <|\"M\" -> M, \"Ma\" -> Ma, \"tr\" -> trM, \"det\" -> detM, \"ok\" -> ok, \"e2\" -> e2, \"gn\" -> {gs e1 . e1, gs e2 . e2}|>], {k, {{{2, 1, 0}, {4, 1, 1}}, {{2, 1, 0}, {3, 3, 0}}, {{3, 1, 0}, {6, 1, 1}}, {{3, 1, 0}, {5, 3, 0}}, {{3, 2, 0}, {6, 3, 1}}, {{3, 2, 0}, {5, 5, 0}}}}];\ndump[Table[{k, c2Res[k][\"ok\"], c2Res[k][\"M\"], c2Res[k][\"Ma\"], c2Res[k][\"tr\"], c2Res[k][\"det\"], c2Res[k][\"e2\"], c2Res[k][\"gn\"]}, {k, Keys[c2Res]}]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"953927\" data-output-id=\"13\" data-out-n=\"211\" data-sub-idx=\"6\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"26\" data-sub-start=\"16\" data-sub-end=\"16\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[211]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><pre class=\"vscode-wolfram-text-output\">No output at Out[211]</pre></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[211]= No output at Out[211]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "bf00a644-91f4-436e-bf6a-1f329f65da11"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## C2/C3 structure: H1 is exactly LINEAR in zeta; a1 = alpha + beta H1 on the d = 2 branches; full characteristic polynomial; degrees of a1, b1 in zeta",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "checks = Join[checks, ck]; ck = <||>;\n(* (i) H1(zeta) = H1(0) + Sum_i zeta_i (|Lam| - E1_ii) as an exact operator identity on every HW weight sector (orders >= 2 in zeta vanish) *)\nck[\"H1 operator: degree <= 1 in zeta and H1^(1) = Sum_i zeta_i (|Lam| - E^(1)_ii), all sectors of the three reps\"] = And @@ Flatten[Table[Module[{R = build[Lam], ops = opPolyOf[Lam, mu], sec = secOf[Lam, mu], ser, lamT = Total[Lam], X},\n   ser = opSeries[ops, \"H1\", zz, 3]; X = Sum[zz[[i]] (lamT IdentityMatrix[Length[sec]] - Normal[R[\"E1\"][[i, i]][[sec, sec]]]), {i, 3}];\n   {Union[Flatten[Expand[ser[[3]]]]] === {0} && Union[Flatten[Expand[ser[[4]]]]] === {0}, Union[Flatten[Expand[ser[[2]] - X]]] === {0}}], {Lam, repList}, {mu, hwSecsOf[Lam]}]];\n(* (ii) degrees in zeta of the operators a1, b1 (highest nonzero homogeneous part) *)\nck[\"max zeta-degree of H1, a1, b1 operators per rep\"] = Table[Lam -> Table[nm -> Max[Table[Max[Table[If[Union[Flatten[opSeries[opPolyOf[Lam, mu], nm, zz, 3][[k + 1]]]] =!= {0}, k, -1], {k, 0, 3}]], {mu, hwSecsOf[Lam]}]], {nm, {\"H1\", \"a1\", \"b1\"}}], {Lam, repList}];\n(* (iii) d = 2 branches: a1 = alpha + beta H1 on C_B, closed form in (zeta, theta12) *)\nabRes = <||>;\nDo[Module[{M = c2Res[k][\"M\"], Ma = c2Res[k][\"Ma\"], beta, alpha, ok},\n  beta = If[Factor[M[[1, 2]]] === 0, 0, Factor[Ma[[1, 2]]/M[[1, 2]]]]; alpha = Factor[Ma[[1, 1]] - beta M[[1, 1]]];\n  ok = Simplify[Ma - (alpha IdentityMatrix[2] + beta M)] === {{0, 0}, {0, 0}};\n  abRes[k] = <|\"alpha\" -> alpha, \"beta\" -> beta, \"ok\" -> ok|>], {k, Keys[c2Res]}];\n(* (iv) full characteristic polynomial of H1 on the weight-mu space factors: adjoint singlet *)\nck[\"adjoint (2,2,2): char poly of H1 on the whole 10-dim weight space (phiA, eps symbolic): factor degrees\"] = Module[{ops = opPolyOf[{2, 1, 0}, {2, 2, 2}], H},\n  H = opMatE[ops, \"H1\", phiA, eps]; Exponent[#[[1]], lam] & /@ FactorList[Det[lam IdentityMatrix[10] - H]] ];\nck[\"all other sectors of [2,1,0]: full char poly of H1 irreducible of degree = weight-space dim (phiA)\"] = Table[Module[{ops = opPolyOf[{2, 1, 0}, mu], H, n}, H = opMatE[ops, \"H1\", phiA, eps]; n = Length[H]; {mu, n, Exponent[#[[1]], lam] & /@ FactorList[Det[lam IdentityMatrix[n] - H]]}], {mu, {{4, 2, 0}, {4, 1, 1}, {3, 3, 0}}}];\ndump[Join[List @@@ Normal[ck], Table[{k, abRes[k]}, {k, Keys[abRes]}]]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"953927\" data-output-id=\"14\" data-out-n=\"219\" data-sub-idx=\"11\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"28\" data-sub-start=\"17\" data-sub-end=\"17\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[219]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><pre class=\"vscode-wolfram-text-output\">No output at Out[219]</pre></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[219]= No output at Out[219]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "eb2b4b71-77d1-4b2a-a58f-49a7c886e284"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Duality [3,2,0] = [3,1,0]* (x) det^3: sectors mu -> mu' = (6-mu3, 6-mu2, 6-mu1), twist zeta -> zeta' = -(zeta3, zeta2, zeta1)\n\nDerivation from the exact operator form H1(zeta) = H1(0) + Sum_i zeta_i (|Lam| - E^(1)_ii): in V' = V* (x) det^3 the weights are w'_i = 3 - w_(4-i), so |Lam'| = 9 - |Lam| = 5 and |Lam'| - E'_ii = 6 - (|Lam| - E_(4-i)(4-i)); with zeta'_i = -zeta_(4-i) one gets H1'(zeta') = H1(zeta) + 6/theta12 - 6 Sum zeta (the constant 6/theta12 is the Casimir shift seen at zeta = 0, all sectors). The test below: this H-relation on the series, and the empirical relation of a, b.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "checks = Join[checks, ck]; ck = <||>;\nmuDual[mu_] := {6 - mu[[3]], 6 - mu[[2]], 6 - mu[[1]]};\nphiDual[phi_] := -Reverse[phi];\nsumPhi = Total[phiA];\ndualRes = <||>;\nDo[Module[{b = bb, mu = bb[[1]], muP, ph = phiA, phP, r1, cands, best, serH, shiftH, th = 31/35},\n  muP = muDual[mu]; phP = phiDual[ph]; r1 = resN[{{3, 1, 0}, b, \"A\"}];\n  cands = Table[Module[{r2 = runBranchT[{3, 2, 0}, muP, ic2, phP, nMaxN, thN]}, {ic2, r2}], {ic2, lauData[{{3, 2, 0}, muP}][\"mult\"]}];\n  (* pick the copy for which H1' - H1 = 6/theta12 - 6 eps Sum phi exactly *)\n  Do[Module[{r2 = c[[2]], d1, ok},\n    dD = r1[\"D0\"]; \n    ok = Quiet[Check[Union[Table[Together[Simplify[(r2[\"series\"][\"H1\"][[n + 1]] /. sq -> Sqrt[r2[\"D0\"]]) - (r1[\"series\"][\"H1\"][[n + 1]] /. sq -> Sqrt[r1[\"D0\"]]) - Switch[n, 0, 6/th, 1, -6 sumPhi, _, 0]]], {n, 0, nMaxN}]] === {0}, False]];\n    If[ok, dualRes[b] = <|\"copy2\" -> c[[1]], \"r2\" -> r2, \"muP\" -> muP|>]], {c, cands}];\n  If[! KeyExistsQ[dualRes, b], dualRes[b] = <|\"copy2\" -> None, \"muP\" -> muP, \"r2\" -> cands[[1, 2]]|>]], {bb, branchesOf[{3, 1, 0}]}];\nck[\"H-duality: H1'(zeta') = H1(zeta) + 6/theta12 - 6 Sum zeta, all 10 branches (a matching copy exists), all orders\"] = Table[{b, dualRes[b][\"muP\"], dualRes[b][\"copy2\"]}, {b, branchesOf[{3, 1, 0}]}];\n(* empirical relation of a: residual a1' + a1 - 4 H1, and of b *)\nDo[Module[{r1 = resN[{{3, 1, 0}, b, \"A\"}], r2 = dualRes[b][\"r2\"], S1, S2},\n  S1 = r1[\"series\"]; S2 = r2[\"series\"];\n  dualRes[b] = Append[dualRes[b], \"aRes\" -> Table[Simplify[(S2[\"a1\"][[n + 1]] /. sq -> Sqrt[r2[\"D0\"]]) + (S1[\"a1\"][[n + 1]] /. sq -> Sqrt[r1[\"D0\"]]) - 4 (S1[\"H1\"][[n + 1]] /. sq -> Sqrt[r1[\"D0\"]])], {n, 0, 4}]]], {b, branchesOf[{3, 1, 0}]}];\nck[\"a-residual a1' + a1 - 4 H1 (orders 0..4) per branch\"] = Table[{b, dualRes[b][\"aRes\"]}, {b, branchesOf[{3, 1, 0}]}];\ndump[List @@@ Normal[ck]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"953927\" data-output-id=\"15\" data-out-n=\"229\" data-sub-idx=\"10\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"30\" data-sub-start=\"20\" data-sub-end=\"20\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[229]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><pre class=\"vscode-wolfram-text-output\">No output at Out[229]</pre></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
